Melvin the caveman was in the gnomish mining town.  His club had been
reduced to +0, his armor disintegrated several levels ago.  He had a
fair amount of scrolls but nothing to trade them for.  Leaving a shop,
several rothes surrounded him.  With his last ounce of strength he 
